---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="3 Quick Fixes to Climb Google Maps | Sinchi"
  description="Three immediate Google Business Profile fixes any NZ local business owner can do today to improve Google Maps rankings and phone calls."
>
  <section class="section fixes-hero-section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="lead-magnet-header">
        <div class="badge-pill">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          <span>Actionable Local SEO Guide</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="guide-title">3 quick fixes to climb Google Maps today</h1>
        <p class="guide-subtitle">
          These are the exact three high-impact optimizations you can make immediately without hiring an agency or spending weeks learning SEO.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- The 3 Actionable Fixes -->
      <div class="fixes-container">
        <!-- Fix 1 -->
        <article class="fix-card card-surface">
          <div class="fix-number-badge">1</div>
          <div class="fix-body">
            <h2 class="fix-heading">Get your primary and secondary categories right</h2>
            <p class="fix-summary">
              Your primary Google Business category is the single biggest algorithmic lever for local search. Setting the wrong primary category immediately depresses your visibility across all nearby searches.
            </p>
            <div class="fix-action-box">
              <div class="action-box-header">
                <span class="action-icon">🎯</span>
                <strong>Action Checklist: How to fix it today</strong>
              </div>
              <ul class="fix-steps">
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Search Google for your main trade (e.g. <em>"electrician Auckland"</em>) and inspect the top 3 ranking listings.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Note the category shown directly below their business name (e.g. "Electrician", "Electrical installation service").</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Update your primary category in your profile dashboard to match what customers actually search, then add up to 4-5 relevant secondary categories.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Fix 2 -->
        <article class="fix-card card-surface">
          <div class="fix-number-badge">2</div>
          <div class="fix-body">
            <h2 class="fix-heading">Get steady weekly reviews and reply to every one</h2>
            <p class="fix-summary">
              Google values a consistent review velocity over occasional bursts. More importantly, Google parses keywords inside your owner replies to confirm your local service radius and trade expertise.
            </p>
            <div class="fix-action-box">
              <div class="action-box-header">
                <span class="action-icon">⭐</span>
                <strong>Action Checklist: How to fix it today</strong>
              </div>
              <ul class="fix-steps">
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Send your direct Google review link via SMS within 2 hours of completing a job while the customer is happiest.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Reply to every 5-star review using your trade and suburb naturally (e.g. <em>"Thanks for trusting us for your heat pump installation in Albany, Sarah!"</em>).</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Never copy-paste generic robotic replies like "Thanks for your business."</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Fix 3 -->
        <article class="fix-card card-surface">
          <div class="fix-number-badge">3</div>
          <div class="fix-body">
            <h2 class="fix-heading">Make your website agree with your profile</h2>
            <p class="fix-summary">
              Google uses your website to corroborate what your Google Business Profile claims. If your website is slow, lacks local schema, or has different phone numbers, Google suppresses your rank.
            </p>
            <div class="fix-action-box">
              <div class="action-box-header">
                <span class="action-icon">🌐</span>
                <strong>Action Checklist: How to fix it today</strong>
              </div>
              <ul class="fix-steps">
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Ensure your business name, street/service address, and phone number match character-for-character across your website header and footer.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Create dedicated pages for your main services mentioning the specific NZ suburbs you travel to.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step-check-item">
                  <span class="check-box-icon">✓</span>
                  <span>Add valid <code>LocalBusiness</code> JSON-LD structured data to your site's HTML header.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Lead Capture Form Card -->
      <div class="fixes-capture-card" id="get-checklist">
        <div class="capture-header">
          <span class="capture-badge">Free Printable Download</span>
          <h2 class="capture-title">Want the printable 1-page checklist & reply templates?</h2>
          <p class="capture-desc">
            Enter your email below and we'll send you our complete Google Maps quick-fix PDF checklist and copy-paste review reply templates.
          </p>
        </div>

        <form id="quick-fixes-form" class="fixes-form" novalidate>
          <div class="honeypot-field" aria-hidden="true" style="display: none;">
            <label for="website_hp">Leave empty</label>
            <input type="text" id="website_hp" name="website_hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>

          <div class="form-row-single">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="fixes-email" class="form-label">Your Email Address <span class="required">*</span></label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="fixes-email"
                name="email"
                class="form-input"
                placeholder="name@yourbusiness.co.nz"
                required
              />
              <span class="field-error" id="error-fixes-email"></span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="consent-group">
            <label class="consent-label">
              <input type="checkbox" id="fixes-consent" name="consent" class="consent-checkbox" />
              <span class="consent-text">
                I agree to receive the checklist and occasional NZ local SEO tips (unsubscribe anytime).
              </span>
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="form-submit-row">
            <button type="submit" id="fixes-submit-btn" class="btn btn-primary btn-submit">
              <span class="btn-text">Send me the 3 fixes</span>
              <span class="btn-loader" style="display: none;">Sending checklist...</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="form-global-error" id="fixes-form-error" style="display: none;"></div>

          <p class="microcopy">
            🔒 Instant PDF delivery. No sales pitch, ever.
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <!-- Full Audit Alternative -->
      <div class="full-audit-callout card-surface">
        <h3 class="callout-title">Prefer us to audit your specific listing?</h3>
        <p class="callout-text">
          Get a comprehensive, personalised geo-grid visibility report showing your exact competitors and ranking weaknesses across every suburb.
        </p>
        <a href="/free-google-check" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Request my free visibility check →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('quick-fixes-form') as HTMLFormElement;
  const submitBtn = document.getElementById('fixes-submit-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const btnText = submitBtn?.querySelector('.btn-text') as HTMLElement;
  const btnLoader = submitBtn?.querySelector('.btn-loader') as HTMLElement;
  const formError = document.getElementById('fixes-form-error') as HTMLElement;

  if (form) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      formError.style.display = 'none';

      const emailInput = document.getElementById('fixes-email') as HTMLInputElement;
      const errorEmail = document.getElementById('error-fixes-email') as HTMLElement;
      errorEmail.textContent = '';

      const email = emailInput?.value.trim();
      const consent = (document.getElementById('fixes-consent') as HTMLInputElement)?.checked;
      const hp = (document.getElementById('website_hp') as HTMLInputElement)?.value;

      if (!email) {
        errorEmail.textContent = 'Please enter your email address.';
        return;
      }

      submitBtn.disabled = true;
      btnText.style.display = 'none';
      btnLoader.style.display = 'inline';

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/submit-fixes', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ email, consent, website_hp: hp })
        });

        const result = await res.json();

        if (res.ok && result.success) {
          window.location.href = result.redirect || '/thanks?source=fixes';
        } else {
          formError.textContent = result.error || 'Failed to submit. Please try again.';
          formError.style.display = 'block';
          submitBtn.disabled = false;
          btnText.style.display = 'inline';
          btnLoader.style.display = 'none';
        }
      } catch (err) {
        formError.textContent = 'Network error. Please try again.';
        formError.style.display = 'block';
        submitBtn.disabled = false;
        btnText.style.display = 'inline';
        btnLoader.style.display = 'none';
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .fixes-hero-section {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .lead-magnet-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .guide-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .guide-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .fixes-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .fix-card {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .fix-number-badge {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-plum) 100%);
    color: var(--color-white);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(109, 16, 163, 0.25);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .fix-body {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .fix-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .fix-summary {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .fix-action-box {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F9F4FD 0%, #F5ECFA 100%);
    border: 1px solid #E6D4F5;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);
    padding: 1.35rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(109, 16, 163, 0.04);
  }

  .action-box-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-plum);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .action-icon {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .fix-steps {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .step-check-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .check-box-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Capture Card */
  .fixes-capture-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2A0840 0%, #190328 100%);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border: 1.5px solid #8E2BC9;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(42, 8, 64, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .capture-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .capture-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .capture-title {
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .capture-desc {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: #D6C2EB;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .fixes-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .form-row-single {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .form-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .required {
    color: #FF8080;
  }

  .form-input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.95rem 1.15rem;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
    color: var(--color-plum);
  }

  .form-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #8E2BC9;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(142, 43, 201, 0.35);
  }

  .field-error {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #FF9999;
    min-height: 1rem;
  }

  .consent-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .consent-checkbox {
    margin-top: 3px;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    accent-color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .consent-text {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #D6C2EB;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .btn-submit {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.05rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .microcopy {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: #BBA0D9;
  }

  .form-global-error {
    background-color: #FFEEEE;
    border: 1px solid #FFCCCC;
    color: #C03232;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Full Audit Callout */
  .full-audit-callout {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .callout-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .callout-text {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .fix-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
